# Test fixtures ARE tracked, deliberately: the suite must run on a fresh clone.
# Frozen real NBA responses (game 0022500610) — public data, no secrets. This negation
# is defensive; no rule above currently catches the path. Keep it so a future broad
# rule (e.g. "fixtures/") cannot silently un-track them and reintroduce a suite that
# only passes on the author's machine.
!etl/tests/fixtures/
!etl/tests/fixtures/**
